<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANBEECO SAYS TALKS AT ADVANCED STAGE.</title>
<headline>ANBEECO SAYS TALKS AT ADVANCED STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anbeeco Investment Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that negotiations first announced on July 1 were now at an advanced stage.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made. No further details were given in the brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
